<template>
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">Color Picker</h1>
    <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro">
      Interactive color selection with swatch trigger, inline panel, alpha channel, preset palettes, and multiple output formats.
      Supports hex, rgb, and hsl modes.
    </p>

    <!-- ═══ Basic ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-basic class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-basic>

    <!-- ═══ Inline ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-inline class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-inline>

    <!-- ═══ With Alpha ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-alpha class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-alpha>

    <!-- ═══ Presets / Swatches ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-presets class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-presets>

    <!-- ═══ Formats ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-formats class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-formats>

    <!-- ═══ Sizes ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-sizes class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-sizes>

    <!-- ═══ Disabled & Readonly ═══ -->
    <app-demo-comp-color-picker-disabled class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-color-picker-disabled>

    <!-- ═══ Props Reference ═══ -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading">Props Reference</h2>
      <div class="props-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>value</code></td><td>String</td><td>#000000</td><td>Current color value (hex, rgb, or hsl string).</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>format</code></td><td>String</td><td>hex</td><td>Output format: <code>hex</code>, <code>rgb</code>, or <code>hsl</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>show-alpha</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Show the alpha/opacity slider.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>inline</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Show the panel inline (no popup).</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>presets</code></td><td>Array</td><td>[]</td><td>Array of preset color strings for quick selection.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>size</code></td><td>String</td><td>md</td><td>Swatch trigger size: <code>sm</code>, <code>md</code>, or <code>lg</code>.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Disable interaction entirely.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>readonly</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Display color but prevent editing.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>clearable</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>false</td><td>Allow clearing the selected color.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>label</code></td><td>String</td><td>—</td><td>The swatch's and the panel's accessible name.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>String</td><td>—</td><td>Form field name: a form submits the value under it.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Events Reference ═══ -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading">Events</h2>
      <div class="props-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Detail</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>change</code></td><td>—</td><td>The commit, a native event: when a drag or a key step ends, a preset is picked or a hex is typed. Read <code>value</code>, <code>getHex()</code>, <code>getRgb()</code> and <code>getHsl()</code> on the element.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>value-change</code></td><td><code>{ value }</code></td><td>Its model: fired continuously while dragging the color area or sliders, and with <code>''</code> when it is cleared.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>open-change</code></td><td><code>{ value: boolean }</code></td><td>The popup opened (<code>true</code>) or closed (<code>false</code>).</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Methods, states and parts</h3>
      <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
        The popup is an overlay: driven by its verbs, announced by <code>open-change</code>. What a theme or a page styles on
        <code>&lt;pdx-color-picker&gt;</code>: its custom states on the host and its parts. The classes inside are not public.
      </p>
      <div class="props-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Method, state or part</th><th>What it is</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>show() / close() / toggle()</code></td><td>Open, close or toggle the popup; inline, there is none</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>getHex() / getRgb() / getHsl()</code></td><td>The colour in each format, whatever <code>format</code> is</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>focus() / blur() / clear()</code></td><td>Focus the swatch, leave it, empty the value</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>:state(open) / :state(disabled) / :state(readonly)</code></td><td>The popup is open; <code>disabled</code> or <code>readonly</code> is set</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>[data-part="root"] / [data-part="popup"]</code></td><td>The swatch; the panel, floating or in place when <code>inline</code></td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>[data-part="area"] / [data-part="hue"] / [data-part="alpha"]</code></td><td>The colour area and the two sliders</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>[data-part="input"] / [data-part="clear"] / [data-part="preset"]</code></td><td>The text field, the clear button, a preset colour</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</template>

<script>
@page '/components/color-picker';
@title 'Color Picker — PDX UI';

import '@pdxui/ui/color-picker';
</script>

